## api.crossref.org

Scholarly works metadata.

Licence: No single SPDX id. The public pool is open.

In the provider's own words: "No sign-up is required to use the REST API, and almost none of the metadata is subject to copyright" and "you may use it for any purpose."

Required credit line:

    Scholarly metadata from Crossref.

